{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vending Machine Business Simulator is a simulation game where you start with very little money in your pocket and build a vending empire that spreads across the city. Work for others and once you have the necessary experience and money, start your own business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Manage Your Machines:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase, place, and maintain vending machines across different locations. Keep track of inventory and ensure machines are stocked and operational.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize Profits:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow local events, adjust pricing strategies, and optimize product offerings to maximize revenue and profitability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Empire:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new locations and unlock new type of machines to attract more customers and increase sales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/64a9b10a2c4ad09df6fb03105d8a4537.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/64a9b10a2c4ad09df6fb03105d8a4537.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges such as machine malfunctions, aggressive customers, changing consumer trends, and economic changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Simulation:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a realistic simulation of the vending machine business, including factors like machine maintenance, customer preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on the journey to vending success?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Sale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/7c19b0bd32ae6fed40395faeb54a303b04cd5257.jpg"},{"name":"Vending Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/7c199d2a99056bb96b2c92ee8a13c1992eb502e3.jpg"},{"name":"Location Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/312432e9ce5fb50b3ed9d85868b7d2c89b19f43e.jpg"},{"name":"Master Negotiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/d77c58f17f6850b29d8a846257669243c90581b1.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Fix","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/83da17a7858e0b638948f8a54c546dbf53ed4230.jpg"},{"name":"Vending Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/c1eebaada683e90ab5c2b5e678103f37d860e807.jpg"},{"name":"Hustler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/467579acd7a3a437d3255a21af009c508988ed02.jpg"},{"name":"Businessman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/5a3ff969242538b596f05ada3266ceb60ba7fa19.jpg"},{"name":"Customer Satisfaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/c8c433c1c06b846b5721e59430d883bb11b93e98.jpg"},{"name":"Break Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998750/162c3c206de1afc91a49186dd96873f5d0419b58.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2998750?t=1772953046","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772953046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/bbb366649b887db4d139b1eebf265aa586deb779/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772953046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/bbb366649b887db4d139b1eebf265aa586deb779/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772953046","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vending Machine Business Simulator is a simulation game where you start with very little money in your pocket and build a vending empire that spreads across the city. Work for others and once you have the necessary experience and money, start your own business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Manage Your Machines:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/8fe2306b17f6acd7a229286e06b961eb.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase, place, and maintain vending machines across different locations. Keep track of inventory and ensure machines are stocked and operational.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize Profits:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/718d4322e29a6c7c5bfedfa9d66964d0.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow local events, adjust pricing strategies, and optimize product offerings to maximize revenue and profitability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Empire:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/35d4cbe0ebb585aa79e953b3e849f3ed.mp4?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new locations and unlock new type of machines to attract more customers and increase sales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/64a9b10a2c4ad09df6fb03105d8a4537.poster.avif?t=1772953046\" width=610 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/extras/64a9b10a2c4ad09df6fb03105d8a4537.webm?t=1772953046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges such as machine malfunctions, aggressive customers, changing consumer trends, and economic changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Simulation:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a realistic simulation of the vending machine business, including factors like machine maintenance, customer preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on the journey to vending success?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crow Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998750/41f7374bd60d1ba412ebe726cb7f6fb352a17bd1/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772953046","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2998750/276088059/db7163cc69007c1ebcec29ae7c723e7178d65ed2/1750956636/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747665432","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2998750/276088059/db7163cc69007c1ebcec29ae7c723e7178d65ed2/1750956636/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747665432","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2998750/276088059/db7163cc69007c1ebcec29ae7c723e7178d65ed2/1750956636/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747665432","id":257141050,"name":"Vending Machine Business Simulator Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141050/0c219af3ed643132c83ea042d214f5e3a0045e74/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747665432"}],"name":"Vending Machine Business Simulator","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Vending Machine Business Simu